<title>UK: Telkom at $30.625 in London at 0816 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $30.625 in London at 0816 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $30.625 and London at 0816 GMT on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $30.5 and the day's high of $30.625.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday $30.70. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
